            {
              "id": "tls.protocol.tls1_0",
              "name": "TlsProtocolTls1_0",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Deprecated TLSv1.0 is supported"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "TLSv1.0 is deprecated by RFC 8996 and vulnerable to a long list of downgrade and padding-oracle attacks. Disable it and require TLS 1.2+."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "**Deprecated TLSv1.0 is supported**\n\nTLSv1.0 is deprecated by RFC 8996 and vulnerable to a long list of downgrade and padding-oracle attacks. Disable it and require TLS 1.2+.\n\nObserved: `TLSv1.0: accepted`\n\n### Remediation\nDisable TLS 1.0 and TLS 1.1 (deprecated by RFC 8996) and allow only TLS 1.2/1.3 with modern cipher suites.\n\n**Nginx**\n```\nssl_protocols TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3;\nssl_prefer_server_ciphers off;\nssl_ciphers ECDHE-ECDSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:ECDHE-RSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:ECDHE-ECDSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384:ECDHE-RSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384:ECDHE-ECDSA-CHACHA20-POLY1305:ECDHE-RSA-CHACHA20-POLY1305;\n```\n\n**Apache**\n```\nSSLProtocol -all +TLSv1.2 +TLSv1.3\nSSLCipherSuite ECDHE-ECDSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:ECDHE-RSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:ECDHE-ECDSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384:ECDHE-RSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384\nSSLHonorCipherOrder off\n```\n\n**Cloudflare**\n```\nSSL/TLS → Edge Certificates → Minimum TLS Version: TLS 1.2 (or TLS 1.3).\n```\n\n### References\n- https://owasp.org/www-project-secure-headers/",
                "markdown": "**Deprecated TLSv1.0 is supported**\n\nTLSv1.0 is deprecated by RFC 8996 and vulnerable to a long list of downgrade and padding-oracle attacks. Disable it and require TLS 1.2+.\n\nObserved: `TLSv1.0: accepted`\n\n### Remediation\nDisable TLS 1.0 and TLS 1.1 (deprecated by RFC 8996) and allow only TLS 1.2/1.3 with modern cipher suites.\n\n**Nginx**\n```\nssl_protocols TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3;\nssl_prefer_server_ciphers off;\nssl_ciphers ECDHE-ECDSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:ECDHE-RSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:ECDHE-ECDSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384:ECDHE-RSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384:ECDHE-ECDSA-CHACHA20-POLY1305:ECDHE-RSA-CHACHA20-POLY1305;\n```\n\n**Apache**\n```\nSSLProtocol -all +TLSv1.2 +TLSv1.3\nSSLCipherSuite ECDHE-ECDSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:ECDHE-RSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:ECDHE-ECDSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384:ECDHE-RSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384\nSSLHonorCipherOrder off\n```\n\n**Cloudflare**\n```\nSSL/TLS → Edge Certificates → Minimum TLS Version: TLS 1.2 (or TLS 1.3).\n```\n\n### References\n- https://owasp.org/www-project-secure-headers/"
