            {
              "id": "http.header.server",
              "name": "HttpHeaderServer",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Server header discloses software version"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Version banners let attackers map the target to known CVEs; hide the token and patch promptly."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "**Server header discloses software version**\n\nVersion banners let attackers map the target to known CVEs; hide the token and patch promptly.\n\nObserved: `Server: nginx/1.18.0`\n\n### Remediation\nRemove version banners from Server, X-Powered-By and X-AspNet-Version.  Banner grabbing is the first step of most targeted exploitation playbooks.\n\n**Nginx**\n```\n# nginx.conf (http block)\nserver_tokens off;\nmore_clear_headers Server X-Powered-By X-AspNet-Version X-AspNetMvc-Version;  # headers-more module\n# without headers-more:\nproxy_hide_header X-Powered-By;\n```\n\n**Apache**\n```\nServerTokens Prod\nServerSignature Off\n<IfModule mod_headers.c>\n    Header unset X-Powered-By\n    Header unset X-AspNet-Version\n    Header unset Server\n</IfModule>\n```\n\n**Cloudflare**\n```\nCloudflare already strips/rewrites the Server header; add Transform Rules for X-Powered-By.\n```\n\n### References\n- https://owasp.org/www-project-secure-headers/",
                "markdown": "**Server header discloses software version**\n\nVersion banners let attackers map the target to known CVEs; hide the token and patch promptly.\n\nObserved: `Server: nginx/1.18.0`\n\n### Remediation\nRemove version banners from Server, X-Powered-By and X-AspNet-Version.  Banner grabbing is the first step of most targeted exploitation playbooks.\n\n**Nginx**\n```\n# nginx.conf (http block)\nserver_tokens off;\nmore_clear_headers Server X-Powered-By X-AspNet-Version X-AspNetMvc-Version;  # headers-more module\n# without headers-more:\nproxy_hide_header X-Powered-By;\n```\n\n**Apache**\n```\nServerTokens Prod\nServerSignature Off\n<IfModule mod_headers.c>\n    Header unset X-Powered-By\n    Header unset X-AspNet-Version\n    Header unset Server\n</IfModule>\n```\n\n**Cloudflare**\n```\nCloudflare already strips/rewrites the Server header; add Transform Rules for X-Powered-By.\n```\n\n### References\n- https://owasp.org/www-project-secure-headers/"
