            {
              "id": "http.permissions_policy.missing",
              "name": "HttpPermissions_policyMissing",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Permissions-Policy header is missing"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Without Permissions-Policy, embedded third-party frames may request camera, microphone, geolocation and other powerful features."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "**Permissions-Policy header is missing**\n\nWithout Permissions-Policy, embedded third-party frames may request camera, microphone, geolocation and other powerful features.\n\nObserved: `Permissions-Policy: absent`\n\n### Remediation\nRestrict powerful browser features with Permissions-Policy.  Deny everything you do not explicitly need and never grant camera/microphone/geolocation to '*'.\n\n**Nginx**\n```\nadd_header Permissions-Policy \"accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()\" always;\n```\n\n**Apache**\n```\nHeader always set Permissions-Policy \"accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()\"\n```\n\n**Cloudflare**\n```\nTransform Rule → Set response header Permissions-Policy with an explicit allow-list.\n```\n\n### References\n- https://owasp.org/www-project-secure-headers/",
                "markdown": "**Permissions-Policy header is missing**\n\nWithout Permissions-Policy, embedded third-party frames may request camera, microphone, geolocation and other powerful features.\n\nObserved: `Permissions-Policy: absent`\n\n### Remediation\nRestrict powerful browser features with Permissions-Policy.  Deny everything you do not explicitly need and never grant camera/microphone/geolocation to '*'.\n\n**Nginx**\n```\nadd_header Permissions-Policy \"accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()\" always;\n```\n\n**Apache**\n```\nHeader always set Permissions-Policy \"accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()\"\n```\n\n**Cloudflare**\n```\nTransform Rule → Set response header Permissions-Policy with an explicit allow-list.\n```\n\n### References\n- https://owasp.org/www-project-secure-headers/"
